# WordPress Theme Standards

## Theme Structure

```
skeleton/
├── acf-blocks/                 # ACF block templates
│   ├── preview/                # Block preview images
│   ├── hero-slider.php
│   ├── faqs.php
│   └── ...
├── functions/                  # PHP function files
│   ├── define-constants.php
│   ├── enqueue-scripts.php
│   ├── helpers.php
│   ├── hooks.php
│   ├── register-acf-blocks.php
│   ├── register-nav-menus.php
│   └── ...
├── images/
│   ├── icons/                  # SVG icons
│   └── svg/                    # SVG assets
├── js/                         # Compiled JavaScript
│   ├── custom.js
│   ├── plugins.js
│   └── vendor/
├── src/
│   ├── js/
│   │   ├── custom/             # Custom JS files
│   │   └── plugins/            # Third-party plugins
│   └── sass/
│       ├── partials/
│       │   ├── acf-blocks/     # Block styles
│       │   ├── components/     # Component styles
│       │   ├── config/         # _colors, _maps, _variables
│       │   ├── helpers/        # Helper classes
│       │   ├── mixins/         # _breakpoints, _rem
│       │   ├── templates/      # Template styles
│       │   └── utilities/      # Utility classes
│       └── style.scss          # Main stylesheet
├── template-parts/             # Reusable template parts
├── templates/                  # Page templates
├── functions.php               # Main functions loader
├── header.php
├── footer.php
├── style.css                   # Compiled CSS
└── index.php
```

## Critical Rules Summary

### SCSS - NEVER Do These
```scss
// ❌ Raw px values
font-size: 18px;
padding: 24px;

// ❌ @media directly
@media (min-width: 768px) { }

// ❌ Desktop-first / breakpoint-down
@include media-breakpoint-down(md) { }

// ❌ Inline styles in PHP
style="color: red;"
```

### SCSS - ALWAYS Do These
```scss
// ✅ Use rem-calc() for fixed values
gap: rem-calc(16);
border-radius: rem-calc(8);

// ✅ Use fluid() for responsive values
font-size: fluid(16, 18);
padding: fluid(16, 24);

// ✅ Use media-breakpoint-up() only
@include media-breakpoint-up(md) { }
@include media-breakpoint-up(lg) { }

// ✅ Mobile-first approach
.component {
	// Mobile styles first (default)
	font-size: fluid(14, 16);

	@include media-breakpoint-up(md) {
		// Tablet and up
	}

	@include media-breakpoint-up(lg) {
		// Desktop and up
		font-size: fluid(18, 24);
	}
}
```

### PHP - ALWAYS
```php
// ✅ Escape all output
echo esc_html( $text );
echo esc_attr( $attribute );
echo esc_url( $url );

// ✅ Sanitize all input
$clean = sanitize_text_field( $_POST['field'] );

// ✅ Use text domain 'skel'
__( 'Text', 'skel' );
esc_html_e( 'Text', 'skel' );

// ✅ Prefix all functions with skel_
function skel_function_name() { }

// ✅ Use WordPress hooks
add_action( 'wp_enqueue_scripts', 'skel_enqueue_scripts' );
add_filter( 'body_class', 'skel_body_classes' );
```

### JavaScript - ALWAYS
```javascript
// ✅ Arrow function IIFE
(() => {
	// Code here
})();

// ✅ NO spaces in parentheses (standard JS)
if (condition) { }
document.querySelector('.selector');

// ✅ const/let, never var
const element = document.querySelector('.element');

// ✅ camelCase naming
const headerNavToggle = document.querySelector('.header-nav-toggle');
```

