## Data Attributes System

### Animation Attributes
- `data-inview` - Element observed for viewport entry
- `data-inview-repeat` - Animation repeats on re-entry
- `data-aos` - Animation type (e.g., "fade-up")
- `data-aos-stagger-item` - Staggered animations

### Toggle Attributes
- `data-toggle-click` - Toggle on click
- `data-toggle-group` - Group elements together
- `data-toggle-link` - Link elements to toggle together
- `data-toggle-hover` - Toggle on hover
- `data-esc` - Close on Escape key

### Other Attributes
- `data-lenis-prevent` - Prevent Lenis smooth scroll

## Security Checklist

- [ ] All output is escaped with appropriate function
- [ ] All input is sanitized before use
- [ ] All database queries use prepared statements
- [ ] Nonces are used for form submissions
- [ ] Capability checks before sensitive operations
- [ ] No direct file access (check ABSPATH)
- [ ] Text domain 'skel' used for all translatable strings
- [ ] No hardcoded URLs or paths

## Performance Checklist

- [ ] Scripts loaded in footer with `defer`
- [ ] Styles properly enqueued (not inline)
- [ ] Images lazy loaded (except first visible)
- [ ] First image uses `fetchpriority="high"`
- [ ] jQuery dequeued if not needed
- [ ] Minified CSS/JS in production

## Accessibility Checklist

- [ ] Skip link present (`.skip-link`)
- [ ] Proper heading hierarchy
- [ ] Focus indicators visible (`:focus-visible`)
- [ ] Color contrast meets WCAG AA
- [ ] Alt text for images
- [ ] ARIA labels for interactive elements
- [ ] `aria-expanded` for toggleable content
- [ ] `aria-hidden` for decorative elements
- [ ] Keyboard navigation works
